menu "HTTP Server"

    config HTTP_SERVER_LUA_MODULES_API
        bool "Lua module listing API"
        default y
        help
            Serve GET /api/lua-modules, which the portal uses to list the Lua
            modules compiled into this build.

            This is the only part of the server that reads the module list
            straight out of app_claw, so turning it off drops that dependency
            and lets the server be built without the capability framework. The
            dependency itself is declared in idf_component.yml, because a
            condition on this symbol inside CMakeLists does not take effect.

endmenu
